OL,3,GNEWSAKate Mosse's new book is a 'love
OL,4,Aletter' to Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FBest-selling author Kate Mosse has said
OL,7,FSussex in autumn is "like nowhere else"
OL,8,Fas she marks the publication of her
OL,9,Flatest book exploring the season.
OL,11,FThe Chichester-based writer said
OL,12,FAutumn: The Story of a Season draws
OL,13,Finspiration from Sussex landscapes
OL,14,Fincluding Fishbourne marshes,
OL,15,FChanctonbury Ring and Devil's Dyke, as
OL,16,Fwell as traditions such as the Lewes
OL,17,Fbonfire celebrations.
OL,19,F"It's a book about memory, belonging.
OL,20,FIt's a book about what it means to come
OL,21,Ffrom somewhere," she said.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
